  "description": "This library gives you easy access to Telegram Bot API so you can start building useful bots for Telegram.\n\nRelease Notes:\n- Bot API 9.5 https://core.telegram.org/bots/api-changelog#march-1-2026\n- Fix IsServiceMessage for Gift & UniqueGift (true)\n- ReactionType* classes implement useful ToString()\n- SendHtml: combine captions if found both above & below media\n- Added msg.ToHtml(withMedia, withPreview, withKeyboard) for full html compatible with SendHtml helper",
